        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-EDGE-PULL-SB\"><b>Laurey Edge Pull in Satin Brass</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Satin Brass Edge Pull installs with a low profile that will add a modern touch to your kitchen. The Edge Pull in Satin Brass can be mounted horizontally or vertically for use on kitchen cabinet doors or drawers. Choose from an array of sizes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey Satin Brass Cabinet Edge Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Brass</li>\r\n<li>Package with 2 Self Tap Screws - 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LAU-96704:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96204:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96304:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96404:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 8-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LAU-96504:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>C/C Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11-22/25\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-13/20\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
